{"id":"01a04455-c2a2-757a-92a8-f71daec381ef","issue_id":"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.7.5.1.3","event_type":"updated","actor":"Mark Atwood","old_value":"{\"id\":\"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.7.5.1.3\",\"title\":\"Zephyr: PLI encode/decode\",\"status\":\"in_progress\",\"priority\":1,\"issue_type\":\"task\",\"assignee\":\"Mark Atwood\",\"owner\":\"me@mark.atwood.name\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-25T03:43:41.943807Z\",\"created_by\":\"Mark Atwood\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-27T17:42:21.727202Z\",\"started_at\":\"2026-08-27T17:42:21.727202Z\",\"lease_expires_at\":\"2026-08-27T17:47:21.727202Z\",\"heartbeat_at\":\"2026-08-27T17:42:21.727202Z\",\"dependencies\":[{\"issue_id\":\"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.7.5.1.3\",\"depends_on_id\":\"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.7.5.1\",\"type\":\"parent-child\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-25T03:43:42.613994Z\",\"created_by\":\"Mark Atwood\",\"metadata\":\"{}\"}]}","new_value":"{\"notes\":\"Implemented isolated Zephyr Compact CoT PLI codec and Kconfig/CMake wiring. Codec is bounded/allocation-free, emits/accepts exact 17-byte big-endian wire format, supports subtypes 0x02..0x05, validates latitude +/-90e6, longitude +/-180e6, and course \\u003c=35999, preserves full int16 altitude/uint16 speed/team/role ranges, rejects NULL/short/trailing/reserved input, and leaves encode/decode outputs unchanged on every error. Temporary local encoding/decoding also makes overlapping input/output safe. Focused host C test consumes all 8 canonical positive vectors and malformed/boundary cases; strict -Wall/-Wextra/-Werror + UBSan CTest passed 1/1. cppcheck C11 and git diff-check passed. Shared Python Compact CoT suite passed 87/87; Rust canonical vector suite passed 4/4.\"}","created_at":"2026-08-27T17:47:46.210359Z"}
